* "American Lead V", channel 2, stage 2 of 2: V1B, the rest network into V3A, V3A and CH2 MASTER. Driven by stage_ch2.net's node g1b (VG1B, V1B's grid).
* See stage_ch2.net for the modes (the SW_* here follow CH2 MODE too).

V VRAIL x 100 400
R R86 x dp 1k
C C87 dp 0 30u
S VG1B g1b 1 0

* V1B (100k plate, 1k5 with 0.47u, C19 15u in Edge), C20, R35 100k.
T V1B g1b p1b k1b 12AX7
R R27P dp p1b 100k
R R26 k1b 0 1.5k
C C19A k1b 0 0.47u
C C19 k1b c19 15u
R SW_C19 c19 0 1
C C20 p1b v1o 0.047u
R R35 v1o 0 100k

* The relays RYM1 / RYM3B at rest: R32 2M2 with C23 20p to the node nn, R33 680k to ground, R42 475k (the reverb return) to ground; nn is V3A's grid.
R R32 v1o nn 2.2M
C C23 v1o nn 20p
R R33 nn 0 680k
R R42 nn 0 475k

* V3A (100k plate, R44 1k5, both JFET bypasses taken as closed), C33, then R65 220k and CH2 MASTER (1MA wiper pot) with R185 150k (Mark I) and R186 330k (Edge, Mark I).
T V3A nn p3a k3a 12AX7
R R43 dp p3a 100k
R R44 k3a 0 1.5k
C C31 k3a 0 100u
C C32 k3a 0 2.2u
C C33 p3a u3 0.047u
R R65 u3 mc 220k
R R185 mc r185 150k
R SW_R185 r185 0 1e12
R R186 mc r186 330k
R SW_R186 r186 0 1
R VRMS_T mc o2 1
R VRMS_B o2 0 1
